      "blind_answer": 1,
      "confidence": "high",
      "blind_working": "Approximate IE1 values (kJ/mol): B 801, Al 577, Ga 579, In 558, Tl 589. This gives B > Tl > Ga > Al > In, because poor d/f shielding raises IE1 for Ga and Tl."
    },
    {
